  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 1240
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 魂幡炼成后就想设法在宁州弄些修士魂魄淬炼一番，但门派之命我又不敢违抗，只能在其他修士仇杀或争斗天材地宝后捡捡漏。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114896455928451024}
  AvatarIntID: 1
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
